                <p>NSC Action No. 2395: Attack warning channels and
                    procedures for civilians. Secret. 1 p. Department of State, S/S–NSC
                    (Miscellaneous) Files: Lot 66 D 95, Records of Action by the National Security
                    Council.</p>
